{"t":"Star Herb","s":"star-herb-6dfc6","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Star_Herb_baf66f.gif","q":5,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Star Herb</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Star Herb\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star_Herb_baf66f.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Creature%20Products\">Creature Products</a><br/>Plants and Herbs</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.30 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">21 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 3, 2000<br/>Version 6.0 Beta</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20070704165406&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star_Herb_baf66f.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a star herb.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 0.30 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Can be found in <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a>. According to <a href=\"#/wiki/Jean%20Pierre\">Jean Pierre</a>, it has a vanilla-like taste.\n</p><p>Using it on <a href=\"#/wiki/Antlers\">Antlers</a> will create an <a href=\"#/wiki/Antler%20Talisman\">Antler Talisman</a> which is then used with <a href=\"#/wiki/Special%20Flask%20%28Holy%20Water%29\">Holy Water</a> to create a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sacred%20Antler%20Talisman\">Sacred Antler Talisman</a> which is used during the <a href=\"#/quest/the-tainted-souls-quest\">The Tainted Souls Quest</a>.<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Star%20Herb\"><img alt=\"Star Herb\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star_Herb_baf66f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> + <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Antlers\"><img alt=\"Antlers\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Antlers_6e8228.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> = <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Antler%20Talisman\"><img alt=\"Antler Talisman\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Antler_Talisman_375820.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> + <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Special%20Flask%20%28Holy%20Water%29\"><img alt=\"Special Flask (Holy Water)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Special_Flask_Holy_Water_691da3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> = <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sacred%20Antler%20Talisman\"><img alt=\"Sacred Antler Talisman\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sacred_Antler_Talisman_9bcfae.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>\n</p><p>One is required during the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a> to prepare the <a href=\"#/wiki/Banana%20Chocolate%20Shake\">Banana Chocolate Shake</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bruise%20Payne\">Bruise Payne</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ekatrix\">Ekatrix</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fernfang\">Fernfang</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mutated%20Bat\">Mutated Bat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pixie\">Pixie</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Witch\">Witch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yaga%20the%20Crone\">Yaga the Crone</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span clas